"The same literal crossing a process boundary, which is the arm no function-mode"
"case reaches. A newline that arrived as two characters, or as a target's own"
"line ending, shows up here as a stdout mismatch between the six runners rather"
"than as a compile error."

"A top-level note spanning two lines, which every backend erases outright and
 which therefore proves the erasure, not the escaping."

(module text/usage-program
  :doc "Prints its own help text and exits."
  :export [help-text])

(defun help-text [] -> String
  :doc "Two lines and a continuation, as one literal."
  "usage: notes FILE
       notes --help")

(defun ! main [(args (List String))] -> (Result Unit IoError)
  :doc "Print the help text."
  (println (help-text)))
